# Only these reach the image (Dockerfile): AutoMC's code and public pack, the library snapshots, the pinned requirements, the
# changelog. Never devops/, workspace/, downloads/ (nuclear data is mounted), keys, or anything restricted (it lives outside AutoMC).
*
!src/
!library_snapshots/
!docker/requirements.txt
!CHANGELOG.md
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.pytest_cache
**/*.env
**/.env*
